"72-df-t2-theory\">72-df-t2-theory</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}\">\\(\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}\">\\(\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" href=\"?note=3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" title=\"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes\">72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 为同一个固定经典一阶演算中的句子可证性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的算术 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a> 中已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L\">\\(\\vdash_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 取本文件指定的算术语言。这里不再把可证性留作未指定的外部演算。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n[(T_2^{i-1}\\vdash\\theta\\to S_2^i\\vdash\\theta)\\land\n(S_2^i\\vdash\\theta\\to T_2^i\\vdash\\theta)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n[(T_2^{i-1}\\vdash\\theta\\to S_2^i\\vdash\\theta)\\land\n(S_2^i\\vdash\\theta\\to T_2^i\\vdash\\theta)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\theta\\in(\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND})\\cup\n(\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND})\\cup(\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND})\\;\nS_2^i\\vdash\\theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\theta\\in(\\Sigma_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND})\\cup\n(\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{PIND})\\cup(\\Pi_i^b\\text{-}\\mathrm{LIND})\\;\nS_2^i\\vdash\\theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n(S_2\\vdash\\theta\\leftrightarrow T_2\\vdash\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n(S_2\\vdash\\theta\\leftrightarrow T_2\\vdash\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.3.3.4、§1.3.5，印刷 pp. 103、104–105（PDF pp. 115、116–117）。本式按可证性包含关系表述原书的理论包含记号。</li>\n<li>来源明确把这些包含是否严格列为未决；本原子不补写任何严格包含结论。</li>\n<li>来源陈述已比对，读过印刷 p. 105 的 divide-and-conquer 证明；未核验其全部 bootstrapping 前提与替换细节。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-s2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-s2-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-t2-theory","status":"resolved","id":"bde0adecda9b3967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-t2-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]",